  "question": {
    "text": "A cell is connected between the points <math><mi>A</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>C</mi></math> of a circular conductor <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></math> with <math><mi>O</mi></math> as centre and angle <math><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>°</mo><mo>.</mo></math> If <math><msub><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> are the magnitudes of the magnetic fields at <math><mi>O</mi></math> due to the currents in <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></math> respectively, then ratio <math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math> is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0033_dd4f4dbeec62.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 235px;\" /><br />\r&nbsp;"
